          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facade substructure, integrated, Eternit, at plant
na;
UUID: 3d36d2d4-4c0d-30f2-a964-0f000832599a
Included is the production of the individual parts used for the facade construction as well as the transport from the production sites to Switzerland.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at SAPA Building Systems AG in Bellenberg (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at SAPA Building Systems AG. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d36d2d4-4c0d-30f2-a964-0f000832599a.xml</text>
